(1870876, 257729, 29269, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. It almost looks like a face. Oh, well, the longer I look at it I see the face, with chin, neck, eyes, and hair, wonderful! (And no, haven''t had anything to drink or otherwise).</td>', 'Very nice photo. It almost looks like a face. Oh, well, the longer I look at it I see the face, with chin, neck, eyes, and hair, wonderful! (And no, haven''t had anything to drink or otherwise).', '2005-11-16 00:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870877, 257680, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but it doesn''t follow the DPC rules:<br/> <br/>Use a single, artificial light source to dramatically light the subject of your choice.<br/> <br/>The sun isn''t artificial.  So sorry.</td>', 'Nice image, but it doesn''t follow the DPC rules: Use a single, artificial light source to dramatically light the subject of your choice. The sun isn''t artificial.  So sorry.', '2005-11-16 00:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870892, 258097, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  I like how the blue turns to purple to a plum color.  Nice and very imaginative.</td>', 'This is wonderful.  I like how the blue turns to purple to a plum color.  Nice and very imaginative.', '2005-11-16 00:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
