(1870935, 257776, 29269, '<td valign="top">Love the diagonal composition and the light. I had similar idea (image 258266 in my portfolio) but this one works much better. You''ve added drama and mood with the lighting. Good luck!</td>', 'Love the diagonal composition and the light. I had similar idea (image 258266 in my portfolio) but this one works much better. You''ve added drama and mood with the lighting. Good luck!', '2005-11-16 00:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
