(1870957, 257388, 29269, '<td valign="top">I think that the challenge specifically stated "single, artificial light source"... oh well. It does seem like the light comes from your direction on the grass, so that would be a stretch to fit. However, the subject is still not dramatic for high score.</td>', 'I think that the challenge specifically stated "single, artificial light source"... oh well. It does seem like the light comes from your direction on the grass, so that would be a stretch to fit. However, the subject is still not dramatic for high score.', '2005-11-16 00:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
