(1871002, 258056, 29269, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t come across as a flattering image to me. I think that you would have been better off with a tighter crop, both from the top and from the bottom, leaving the nostrils and half of the forehead out of the photo. Eyes are beautiful and do not need the nose for distraction. The top would go out because of the symmetry.</td>', 'This doesn''t come across as a flattering image to me. I think that you would have been better off with a tighter crop, both from the top and from the bottom, leaving the nostrils and half of the forehead out of the photo. Eyes are beautiful and do not need the nose for distraction. The top would go out because of the symmetry.', '2005-11-16 00:37:02.000000', NULL, 1),
