(1871071, 257725, 47487, '<td valign="top">That''s totally gorgeous. The light doesn''t look very directional, but I''m going to give you the benefit of the doubt, considering the mirrors, and score this one a 9. VERY cool-looking, excellently focused.</td>', 'That''s totally gorgeous. The light doesn''t look very directional, but I''m going to give you the benefit of the doubt, considering the mirrors, and score this one a 9. VERY cool-looking, excellently focused.', '2005-11-16 00:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
