(1871083, 257865, 29906, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but you got to be more careful with sharpening tools, the halo around the flame is okay, but the one around the edges of the lighter is very distracting.</td>', 'Nice photo, but you got to be more careful with sharpening tools, the halo around the flame is okay, but the one around the edges of the lighter is very distracting.', '2005-11-16 00:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
