(1871086, 257995, 15711, '<td valign="top">COOL.  Love the blue.  That tiny glint in the right eye makes the shot for me. Maybe crop out some of the area to the viewer''s left, but that''s my taste. 8</td>', 'COOL.  Love the blue.  That tiny glint in the right eye makes the shot for me. Maybe crop out some of the area to the viewer''s left, but that''s my taste. 8', '2005-11-16 00:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
