(1871111, 257688, 15711, '<td valign="top">10 10 10 10 10<br/> <br/>This is ultimately the most clever entry.  Great shadow and the use of the paper and drawing and the artist''s reference.  BRAVO!!!!!!  (clap clap clap)</td>', '10 10 10 10 10 This is ultimately the most clever entry.  Great shadow and the use of the paper and drawing and the artist''s reference.  BRAVO!!!!!!  (clap clap clap)', '2005-11-16 00:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1871113, 258239, 29269, '<td valign="top">Well, the challenge stated "artificial" light source and yours look like a daylight that is coming from the window.<br/>Still, hardly a dramatic image. And although there is no way around it, using a wide angle lens inside causes right angles and straight lines to warp, as observed in this image. Sometimes it provides with dramatic effect, but in this one it subtracts from the image (in my opinion that is). <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'Well, the challenge stated "artificial" light source and yours look like a daylight that is coming from the window.Still, hardly a dramatic image. And although there is no way around it, using a wide angle lens inside causes right angles and straight lines to warp, as observed in this image. Sometimes it provides with dramatic effect, but in this one it subtracts from the image (in my opinion that is). Good luck!', '2005-11-16 00:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
