(1872216, 258192, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love this.  So abstract and graphic.  Beautiful collar bone and shoulder.  Lovely. A study in the human form. 7</td>', 'Love this.  So abstract and graphic.  Beautiful collar bone and shoulder.  Lovely. A study in the human form. 7', '2005-11-16 09:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
