(1872219, 257946, 15711, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of that old James Taylor cover, yet this is more artful and interesting with the light and shadow.  Great shot!!! 8</td>', 'Reminds me of that old James Taylor cover, yet this is more artful and interesting with the light and shadow.  Great shot!!! 8', '2005-11-16 09:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
