(1872224, 257964, 35602, '<td valign="top">Really love the colors on this one.  I guess it is some sort of a chinese lantern, though not sure.  Thought it may have been a little out of focus, though the use of light was very good.</td>', 'Really love the colors on this one.  I guess it is some sort of a chinese lantern, though not sure.  Thought it may have been a little out of focus, though the use of light was very good.', '2005-11-16 09:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1872227, 258024, 15711, '<td valign="top">Her pose seems a tad awkward. I think I''d like it better if she were more straight and the crop included more of her torso. Nice lighting. I like her hair tumbling over the right shoulder.</td>', 'Her pose seems a tad awkward. I think I''d like it better if she were more straight and the crop included more of her torso. Nice lighting. I like her hair tumbling over the right shoulder.', '2005-11-16 09:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
