(1872241, 258106, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just think this is beautiful.  The slight curl of the hair on the shoulder is very artsy. Nicely done for sure!!! 9</td>', 'I just think this is beautiful.  The slight curl of the hair on the shoulder is very artsy. Nicely done for sure!!! 9', '2005-11-16 09:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1872244, 256778, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is really cool.  Would''ve worked for camouflage as well.  I think the necklace and hint of the ear stud  is a tad distracting, but the rest of the shot is really artfully done.  Good job. 8</td>', 'This is really cool.  Would''ve worked for camouflage as well.  I think the necklace and hint of the ear stud  is a tad distracting, but the rest of the shot is really artfully done.  Good job. 8', '2005-11-16 09:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1872249, 257536, 15711, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  Might I suggest panning back, and showing the entire leaf including the stem with more negative space to the left.  Just my personal taste. I think as it is, it looks too boxed in but the light and detail of the leaf is showcased nicely.</td>', 'Very pretty.  Might I suggest panning back, and showing the entire leaf including the stem with more negative space to the left.  Just my personal taste. I think as it is, it looks too boxed in but the light and detail of the leaf is showcased nicely.', '2005-11-16 09:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
