(1874273, 257553, 47704, '<td valign="top">Mandy?  Is that you?  Beautiful cast of shadows on your chin.</td>', 'Mandy?  Is that you?  Beautiful cast of shadows on your chin.', '2005-11-16 17:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874277, 256774, 47704, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I can say anything about this.</td>', 'I''m not sure I can say anything about this.', '2005-11-16 17:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874282, 256033, 739, '<td valign="top">Not a very interesting subject.</td>', 'Not a very interesting subject.', '2005-11-16 17:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874284, 258254, 47704, '<td valign="top">This is brilliant.  Beautiful use of the light and the subject is perfect.</td>', 'This is brilliant.  Beautiful use of the light and the subject is perfect.', '2005-11-16 17:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874285, 257714, 739, '<td valign="top">I like the camera tilt.  Adds so much more drama to the shot!</td>', 'I like the camera tilt.  Adds so much more drama to the shot!', '2005-11-16 17:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874286, 256848, 41999, '<td valign="top">Absolutely not a single, artificial  light source.</td>', 'Absolutely not a single, artificial  light source.', '2005-11-16 17:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874289, 257989, 47704, '<td valign="top">Great idea but I''m not sure it came out as well as it could.</td>', 'Great idea but I''m not sure it came out as well as it could.', '2005-11-16 17:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874292, 257183, 47704, '<td valign="top">this is eerily fun.</td>', 'this is eerily fun.', '2005-11-16 17:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874295, 255906, 739, '<td valign="top">What is this a picture of? It''s very intriguing.</td>', 'What is this a picture of? It''s very intriguing.', '2005-11-16 17:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874299, 257120, 29009, '<td valign="top">I had to look at this twice for several minutes each to figure out that it was a glass of something (beer?  wine?).  I like the silhouette/backlighting, but feel this image would be stronger if it included more midtones so every element was more easily identifiable.  Overall, it''s a decent shot.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'I had to look at this twice for several minutes each to figure out that it was a glass of something (beer?  wine?).  I like the silhouette/backlighting, but feel this image would be stronger if it included more midtones so every element was more easily identifiable.  Overall, it''s a decent shot.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2005-11-16 17:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874303, 258102, 739, '<td valign="top">you could have ironed the background.  The wrinkles and texture on it is a bit distracting, especially as I travel up the flower.</td>', 'you could have ironed the background.  The wrinkles and texture on it is a bit distracting, especially as I travel up the flower.', '2005-11-16 17:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874307, 258016, 739, '<td valign="top">why the smoke?</td>', 'why the smoke?', '2005-11-16 17:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874309, 256243, 29009, '<td valign="top">Nice toning here.  Unfortunately, the main subject is so overexposed there is significant loss of facial detail and I cant tell what is in front of her face - at first I thought she had something sticking up her nose!  In addition, the focus seems to be off.  This was a good idea, but isn''t as technically strong as it could be.</td>', 'Nice toning here.  Unfortunately, the main subject is so overexposed there is significant loss of facial detail and I cant tell what is in front of her face - at first I thought she had something sticking up her nose!  In addition, the focus seems to be off.  This was a good idea, but isn''t as technically strong as it could be.', '2005-11-16 17:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874310, 257564, 739, '<td valign="top">would have been more interesting if the model did not squint.</td>', 'would have been more interesting if the model did not squint.', '2005-11-16 17:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874311, 257963, 36371, '<td valign="top">Didn''t this challenge say ''''artificial" light?</td>', 'Didn''t this challenge say ''''artificial" light?', '2005-11-16 17:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874315, 258114, 29009, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - this was a good idea.  I''m not so sure about gray as the background color.  Creative though, and well composed.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely done - this was a good idea.  I''m not so sure about gray as the background color.  Creative though, and well composed.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-11-16 17:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874317, 255687, 739, '<td valign="top">The light seems to be hitting the model''s back or behind her, making the background better lit than her.  I think you could have portrayed her better if she is better lid, maybe with something different than white light.</td>', 'The light seems to be hitting the model''s back or behind her, making the background better lit than her.  I think you could have portrayed her better if she is better lid, maybe with something different than white light.', '2005-11-16 17:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874323, 256760, 739, '<td valign="top">The pan has water stains.  Could have put a bit more effort into this shot.</td>', 'The pan has water stains.  Could have put a bit more effort into this shot.', '2005-11-16 17:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874330, 257454, 739, '<td valign="top">Except for that black dot in the middle, this is an otherwise great shot.</td>', 'Except for that black dot in the middle, this is an otherwise great shot.', '2005-11-16 17:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874331, 258011, 40370, '<td valign="top">Cool, looks like a funky universe.</td>', 'Cool, looks like a funky universe.', '2005-11-16 17:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874337, 258209, 739, '<td valign="top">I think you could have shown a "fuller" fridge.  It''s a great idea, but this angle shows the fridge pretty much empty which I think is not your intent.</td>', 'I think you could have shown a "fuller" fridge.  It''s a great idea, but this angle shows the fridge pretty much empty which I think is not your intent.', '2005-11-16 17:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874343, 257725, 739, '<td valign="top">Very creative use of a background to draw out the prominence of the crystal.</td>', 'Very creative use of a background to draw out the prominence of the crystal.', '2005-11-16 17:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874346, 257584, 41999, '<td valign="top">More than one source of artificial light  and one big source that is not artificial.</td>', 'More than one source of artificial light  and one big source that is not artificial.', '2005-11-16 18:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874349, 256249, 41999, '<td valign="top">The sun is not an artificial source of light.</td>', 'The sun is not an artificial source of light.', '2005-11-16 18:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874351, 258054, 40370, '<td valign="top">Beautiful but challenge suggests artificial source so only a 4.</td>', 'Beautiful but challenge suggests artificial source so only a 4.', '2005-11-16 18:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874352, 258112, 739, '<td valign="top">I like the drops spilling from the chin.  Gives the shot so much more drama...why is drinking so fast?</td>', 'I like the drops spilling from the chin.  Gives the shot so much more drama...why is drinking so fast?', '2005-11-16 18:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874355, 256325, 29009, '<td valign="top">Intriguing facial expression.  Unfortunately, the lines on whatever that is in the background are very distracting.  Generally it is good to have the subject well in front of the background and use DOF to emphasize the focal point.  In addition, a diffusing filter might have helped with the skin tones.  Overall, this is a decent shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Intriguing facial expression.  Unfortunately, the lines on whatever that is in the background are very distracting.  Generally it is good to have the subject well in front of the background and use DOF to emphasize the focal point.  In addition, a diffusing filter might have helped with the skin tones.  Overall, this is a decent shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-11-16 18:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874356, 257388, 41999, '<td valign="top">That''s not an artificial source of light in the sky.</td>', 'That''s not an artificial source of light in the sky.', '2005-11-16 18:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874359, 258209, 29009, '<td valign="top">Creative idea here.  Good use of DOF.</td>', 'Creative idea here.  Good use of DOF.', '2005-11-16 18:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874367, 255983, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very striking.</td>', 'Very striking.', '2005-11-16 18:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874368, 256287, 29009, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ll get lots of comments on this!  Lighting is excellent; however, I see some purple fringing on the legs.  Overall, a good shot.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ll get lots of comments on this!  Lighting is excellent; however, I see some purple fringing on the legs.  Overall, a good shot.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-11-16 18:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874369, 257103, 41999, '<td valign="top">The sun is not an artificial source of light.</td>', 'The sun is not an artificial source of light.', '2005-11-16 18:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874372, 258193, 29009, '<td valign="top">This shot would be stronger if it were in better focus.</td>', 'This shot would be stronger if it were in better focus.', '2005-11-16 18:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874373, 258102, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very nice and professional looking.</td>', 'Very nice and professional looking.', '2005-11-16 18:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874375, 258056, 41999, '<td valign="top">Hmm-m-m, two catch lights.</td>', 'Hmm-m-m, two catch lights.', '2005-11-16 18:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874376, 257558, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good capture of facial expression.  It''s a personal opinion, but in portraits like these I like it when the eyes are in the top third of the frame.</td>', 'Good capture of facial expression.  It''s a personal opinion, but in portraits like these I like it when the eyes are in the top third of the frame.', '2005-11-16 18:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874379, 257120, 47956, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous because what you''ve achieved is what I was trying to achieve in a comp in another forum. I used reflected light (bounced off a wall) to get a shillouette of face and glass. My only criticism would be that the glass is held at an angle that grates on the senses (if that makes any sense to you). Less fluid (I used a half full wine glass) in the glass and held at about 45o would have looked better.<br/> <br/>cheers<br/>wrobel.</td>', 'I''m jealous because what you''ve achieved is what I was trying to achieve in a comp in another forum. I used reflected light (bounced off a wall) to get a shillouette of face and glass. My only criticism would be that the glass is held at an angle that grates on the senses (if that makes any sense to you). Less fluid (I used a half full wine glass) in the glass and held at about 45o would have looked better. cheerswrobel.', '2005-11-16 18:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874385, 257282, 739, '<td valign="top">Cropped too tight.  A little more room on the top would be more balanced.</td>', 'Cropped too tight.  A little more room on the top would be more balanced.', '2005-11-16 18:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874387, 257865, 41999, '<td valign="top">Way over-sharpened.</td>', 'Way over-sharpened.', '2005-11-16 18:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874393, 256337, 47704, '<td valign="top">Wow, how cool is this.  Great job.</td>', 'Wow, how cool is this.  Great job.', '2005-11-16 18:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874394, 257680, 40370, '<td valign="top">Sorry, giving natural light a 4, challenge suggested artificial, beautiful corridor though.</td>', 'Sorry, giving natural light a 4, challenge suggested artificial, beautiful corridor though.', '2005-11-16 18:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874395, 258022, 739, '<td valign="top">you could have fooled me...</td>', 'you could have fooled me...', '2005-11-16 18:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874397, 257680, 41999, '<td valign="top">Yeah, but it''s not artificial.</td>', 'Yeah, but it''s not artificial.', '2005-11-16 18:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874405, 257643, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - So silly, borders on ridiculous - I like it, good effort.  Criticism; I do actually wish the lighting was more dramatic to really make this ''fool'' people even more.</td>', '5 - So silly, borders on ridiculous - I like it, good effort.  Criticism; I do actually wish the lighting was more dramatic to really make this ''fool'' people even more.', '2005-11-16 18:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874407, 257736, 40370, '<td valign="top">Too freaky for me, truly unappealing, but creative.</td>', 'Too freaky for me, truly unappealing, but creative.', '2005-11-16 18:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874410, 258074, 739, '<td valign="top">I think too many leaves clouded the simplicity in this shot.</td>', 'I think too many leaves clouded the simplicity in this shot.', '2005-11-16 18:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874412, 256848, 739, '<td valign="top">seems to me that there are more than 1 light source here.</td>', 'seems to me that there are more than 1 light source here.', '2005-11-16 18:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874416, 258134, 40370, '<td valign="top">Fantastic leaf however backdrop looks like your ragged sweatshirt (probably most comfortable though).</td>', 'Fantastic leaf however backdrop looks like your ragged sweatshirt (probably most comfortable though).', '2005-11-16 18:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874419, 257985, 32084, '<td valign="top">This is a very neat idea.  In my opinion sharpess and detail in front and placing the subject off-center would have been nice.</td>', 'This is a very neat idea.  In my opinion sharpess and detail in front and placing the subject off-center would have been nice.', '2005-11-16 18:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874423, 258130, 739, '<td valign="top">too busy.</td>', 'too busy.', '2005-11-16 18:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874424, 258263, 739, '<td valign="top">great job giving these bottles the halo and glow effect.</td>', 'great job giving these bottles the halo and glow effect.', '2005-11-16 18:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874427, 257563, 47704, '<td valign="top">not sure this is a single light source!!</td>', 'not sure this is a single light source!!', '2005-11-16 18:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874428, 257776, 47704, '<td valign="top">simply amazing</td>', 'simply amazing', '2005-11-16 18:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874430, 255906, 40370, '<td valign="top">Now that''s cool, usually don''t care for the "overused" disc idea, but this is original and titled well.</td>', 'Now that''s cool, usually don''t care for the "overused" disc idea, but this is original and titled well.', '2005-11-16 18:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874431, 258157, 47704, '<td valign="top">This is simply an amazing photo.  Beautiful use of available light and shot perfectly.  Great job.</td>', 'This is simply an amazing photo.  Beautiful use of available light and shot perfectly.  Great job.', '2005-11-16 18:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874434, 257707, 29009, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit distracting with the wrinkles and everything.  I''m sorry, but this just doesn''t hold a ton of visual appeal for me.  I guess I''m not seeing very dramatic lighting going on.  The shot seems poorly focused, and has a predictable composition and perspective.  What you might try next time is to bring the subject well in front of the background and use depth of field to emphasize your focal point.  Another thing you might try is shooting the subject from an unusual angle.  <br/> <br/>Hope this helps!</td>', 'The background is a bit distracting with the wrinkles and everything.  I''m sorry, but this just doesn''t hold a ton of visual appeal for me.  I guess I''m not seeing very dramatic lighting going on.  The shot seems poorly focused, and has a predictable composition and perspective.  What you might try next time is to bring the subject well in front of the background and use depth of field to emphasize your focal point.  Another thing you might try is shooting the subject from an unusual angle.   Hope this helps!', '2005-11-16 18:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874436, 255698, 40370, '<td valign="top">Looks great on my new monitor and titled well, fits the challenge all around.</td>', 'Looks great on my new monitor and titled well, fits the challenge all around.', '2005-11-16 18:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874439, 258106, 739, '<td valign="top">Did you try cropping out the shoulder? I thought the lips and chin were more than powerful enough by themselves.  The flaring of the hair away from the neck and the bra-strap took away from the very vivid and simple curves from the head.</td>', 'Did you try cropping out the shoulder? I thought the lips and chin were more than powerful enough by themselves.  The flaring of the hair away from the neck and the bra-strap took away from the very vivid and simple curves from the head.', '2005-11-16 18:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874444, 257559, 41999, '<td valign="top">I could swear I see two lights. Love the mood.</td>', 'I could swear I see two lights. Love the mood.', '2005-11-16 18:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874446, 258054, 41999, '<td valign="top">The sun is not an artificial light source.</td>', 'The sun is not an artificial light source.', '2005-11-16 18:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874450, 256598, 739, '<td valign="top">love the angle of the light.  All the textures of the specimen are illuminated.</td>', 'love the angle of the light.  All the textures of the specimen are illuminated.', '2005-11-16 18:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874455, 257553, 739, '<td valign="top">you made her neck look huge.  Shame on you. :)</td>', 'you made her neck look huge.  Shame on you. :)', '2005-11-16 18:30:57.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1874456, 256741, 40370, '<td valign="top">Fabulous idea, I like that you included the thief''s flashlight, a little grainy looking but what do you expect in low light.</td>', 'Fabulous idea, I like that you included the thief''s flashlight, a little grainy looking but what do you expect in low light.', '2005-11-16 18:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874460, 258088, 40370, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of a unique light source, good focus on the center subject, b&amp;w was a good choice ... 8</td>', 'Excellent use of a unique light source, good focus on the center subject, b&w was a good choice ... 8', '2005-11-16 18:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874466, 257594, 40370, '<td valign="top">Would that be left click or right ... maybe even double; nice photo and meets the challenge ... 7 (bumping up to 8)</td>', 'Would that be left click or right ... maybe even double; nice photo and meets the challenge ... 7 (bumping up to 8)', '2005-11-16 18:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874472, 257769, 29009, '<td valign="top">I can see you put some time and effort into this.  It''s really hard for people to hold still enough to shoot in very low light - you might try a fast shutter speed and then bring up the midtones during post-processing.  Unfortunately, this shot is not in as sharp of a focus as some of the others in the challenge.   It also looks like there is some digital noise on the sweatshirt.  Overall, this is a decent idea that suffers from too many technical deficiencies to score very highly.</td>', 'I can see you put some time and effort into this.  It''s really hard for people to hold still enough to shoot in very low light - you might try a fast shutter speed and then bring up the midtones during post-processing.  Unfortunately, this shot is not in as sharp of a focus as some of the others in the challenge.   It also looks like there is some digital noise on the sweatshirt.  Overall, this is a decent idea that suffers from too many technical deficiencies to score very highly.', '2005-11-16 18:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874476, 257729, 739, '<td valign="top">Incredibly sharp and uncluttered.  I love it.</td>', 'Incredibly sharp and uncluttered.  I love it.', '2005-11-16 18:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874485, 257994, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good capture of facial expression.  Based on the lighting, it looks like the focal point is on the chest?  IMO, this shot would be stronger if it were cropped from the neck up - her facial expression is more interesting than her necklace.</td>', 'Good capture of facial expression.  Based on the lighting, it looks like the focal point is on the chest?  IMO, this shot would be stronger if it were cropped from the neck up - her facial expression is more interesting than her necklace.', '2005-11-16 18:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874498, 257614, 29009, '<td valign="top">Nice story telling here.</td>', 'Nice story telling here.', '2005-11-16 18:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874499, 256774, 41999, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I cannot find a single point in focus. In low light settings such as this, it might be better to set the focus manually with a brighter light, then switch to this dimmer--and wonderfully moody--lighting.</td>', 'Unfortunately, I cannot find a single point in focus. In low light settings such as this, it might be better to set the focus manually with a brighter light, then switch to this dimmer--and wonderfully moody--lighting.', '2005-11-16 18:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874511, 258162, 41999, '<td valign="top">I cannot find anything in focus anywhere, not even the catch lights in the eyes. Low light settings often demand manual focus.</td>', 'I cannot find anything in focus anywhere, not even the catch lights in the eyes. Low light settings often demand manual focus.', '2005-11-16 18:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874512, 255825, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good composition.  I''m not a fan of the border, but I really like the shadow.</td>', 'Good composition.  I''m not a fan of the border, but I really like the shadow.', '2005-11-16 18:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874517, 256778, 34013, '<td valign="top">great idea, very visually interesting<br/></td>', 'great idea, very visually interesting', '2005-11-16 18:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874518, 257329, 34013, '<td valign="top">definately a single light.....nice shot!</td>', 'definately a single light.....nice shot!', '2005-11-16 18:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874524, 257948, 34013, '<td valign="top">how interesting!! what are those things?</td>', 'how interesting!! what are those things?', '2005-11-16 18:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874529, 258244, 34013, '<td valign="top">hotties! :)  nice shot!</td>', 'hotties! :)  nice shot!', '2005-11-16 18:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874532, 257994, 34013, '<td valign="top">not sure if the grain is intentional. might be a little more effective if it were in sepia.  i really like this image, the way she is so forlorn looking, like she is waiting for something/someone......very moody.<br/>nice job.  8 from me.</td>', 'not sure if the grain is intentional. might be a little more effective if it were in sepia.  i really like this image, the way she is so forlorn looking, like she is waiting for something/someone......very moody.nice job.  8 from me.', '2005-11-16 18:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874534, 258209, 34013, '<td valign="top">clever</td>', 'clever', '2005-11-16 18:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874536, 258190, 34013, '<td valign="top">great job!</td>', 'great job!', '2005-11-16 18:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874538, 257757, 34013, '<td valign="top">great idea.</td>', 'great idea.', '2005-11-16 18:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874539, 257771, 47823, '<td valign="top">Not composed very well, probably use the second persons face as end of frame.</td>', 'Not composed very well, probably use the second persons face as end of frame.', '2005-11-16 18:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874541, 258157, 34013, '<td valign="top">love the sepia. fits the image. really cute!</td>', 'love the sepia. fits the image. really cute!', '2005-11-16 18:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
