(1874806, 257760, 42198, '<td valign="top">Not exactly sure what I''m seeing here - The foreground object is distracting, I would have preferred just to see the main light source and the smoke on their own. Focus looks a bit off. I like the colours though, and it meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Not exactly sure what I''m seeing here - The foreground object is distracting, I would have preferred just to see the main light source and the smoke on their own. Focus looks a bit off. I like the colours though, and it meets the challenge well.', '2005-11-16 20:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874807, 258056, 40819, '<td valign="top">I don''t like this shot at all, that is saying something because I think I have seen this women before and loved the shots I have seen. My problem is looking at it quickly it seems her nose is broken, looking closer I see reflected in her eyes what looks like 5 sources of light, I thought it was single light source? Also whatever you did to add contrast makes her skin look like worn leather. It is such a shame she is such a pretty women too.</td>', 'I don''t like this shot at all, that is saying something because I think I have seen this women before and loved the shots I have seen. My problem is looking at it quickly it seems her nose is broken, looking closer I see reflected in her eyes what looks like 5 sources of light, I thought it was single light source? Also whatever you did to add contrast makes her skin look like worn leather. It is such a shame she is such a pretty women too.', '2005-11-16 20:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874811, 257553, 42198, '<td valign="top">It really looks as if it''s her expression that makes this shot ''dramatic'' and not the light. Would have preferred to see more contrast/harsh shadows around her eyes and nose.</td>', 'It really looks as if it''s her expression that makes this shot ''dramatic'' and not the light. Would have preferred to see more contrast/harsh shadows around her eyes and nose.', '2005-11-16 20:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874819, 257973, 42198, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well. You''re using the light to give it a dramatic feel. I like the composition and expression too. Very theatrical!</td>', 'Meets the challenge well. You''re using the light to give it a dramatic feel. I like the composition and expression too. Very theatrical!', '2005-11-16 20:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
