(1875362, 258056, 26313, '<td valign="top">It''s nice to see that the texture of her skin isn''t all neat imaged to hell. It''s a nice shot. I think it might be improved if it wasn''t cropped quite so close on the bottom--it''s as if .5% of her nose is cut off (picky, I know).</td>', 'It''s nice to see that the texture of her skin isn''t all neat imaged to hell. It''s a nice shot. I think it might be improved if it wasn''t cropped quite so close on the bottom--it''s as if .5% of her nose is cut off (picky, I know).', '2005-11-16 22:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875368, 257842, 42256, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the expression captured!</td>', 'Great shot, love the expression captured!', '2005-11-16 22:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875379, 258143, 42256, '<td valign="top">nice try! !</td>', 'nice try! !', '2005-11-16 22:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875384, 256130, 26313, '<td valign="top">Out of focus. Looks as though you''ve oversharpened as well in an attempt to get it in focus. Shallow depth of field was the right choice though, but I guess that''s what makes the focus so tricky. You could try gluing the coin in position. In terms of composition, I''d have moved the coin down and to the left to get the whole shadow in.</td>', 'Out of focus. Looks as though you''ve oversharpened as well in an attempt to get it in focus. Shallow depth of field was the right choice though, but I guess that''s what makes the focus so tricky. You could try gluing the coin in position. In terms of composition, I''d have moved the coin down and to the left to get the whole shadow in.', '2005-11-16 22:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875392, 257564, 26313, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad about the reflection in the glasses, it takes away from it a little.</td>', 'It''s too bad about the reflection in the glasses, it takes away from it a little.', '2005-11-16 22:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
