(1876561, 258056, 19841, '<td valign="top">cropping right at the bottom of the nose gives her an unfortunately comic "kilroy was here" look.  Cropping just above the nostrils would have been better.  Otherwise this is very nice, and technically excellent.</td>', 'cropping right at the bottom of the nose gives her an unfortunately comic "kilroy was here" look.  Cropping just above the nostrils would have been better.  Otherwise this is very nice, and technically excellent.', '2005-11-17 09:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
