(1876578, 255876, 19841, '<td valign="top">While this is a clever idea, the result is a little bland.  Without a clear center of interest, this image becomes a sort of flat texture.  It''s an idea worth working with, though!</td>', 'While this is a clever idea, the result is a little bland.  Without a clear center of interest, this image becomes a sort of flat texture.  It''s an idea worth working with, though!', '2005-11-17 09:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
