(1877587, 257696, 46461, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject, and good execution.<br/>Improvements could be to make the picture more clear/clean.</td>', 'Nice choice of subject, and good execution.Improvements could be to make the picture more clear/clean.', '2005-11-17 16:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877588, 255906, 24454, '<td valign="top">How COOL looking!   So vibrant!</td>', 'How COOL looking!   So vibrant!', '2005-11-17 16:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877591, 257114, 24454, '<td valign="top">That is awesome!   The blues just grab me.  I think this is my favorite of all of them so far.  I wish there was a little less grain -- but that''s just my personal tastes -- It still rates a 10 in my book!    10</td>', 'That is awesome!   The blues just grab me.  I think this is my favorite of all of them so far.  I wish there was a little less grain -- but that''s just my personal tastes -- It still rates a 10 in my book!    10', '2005-11-17 16:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877592, 257760, 36397, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture, it makes you wonder for a moment what it actually shows. I gave up but nevertheless like the composition, the overexposure seems functional and contributing to the overall composition, I like that apparent contradiction.</td>', 'Interesting picture, it makes you wonder for a moment what it actually shows. I gave up but nevertheless like the composition, the overexposure seems functional and contributing to the overall composition, I like that apparent contradiction.', '2005-11-17 16:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877593, 258019, 46461, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and composition. Perhaps a bit macabre. Compositional good. Slight critique: the cut of the pepper could be more vertical, and the topline of the knife end precisly in the corner. Overall a great picture.</td>', 'Interesting subject and composition. Perhaps a bit macabre. Compositional good. Slight critique: the cut of the pepper could be more vertical, and the topline of the knife end precisly in the corner. Overall a great picture.', '2005-11-17 16:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877594, 256610, 24454, '<td valign="top">Austin is a beautiful model!  This is so well done!   What a proud picture to frame and show off both the child -- AND your photographic talent!!!</td>', 'Austin is a beautiful model!  This is so well done!   What a proud picture to frame and show off both the child -- AND your photographic talent!!!', '2005-11-17 16:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877595, 258050, 36397, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting! I would have taken the left black structure off (crop), keeping the glass off-centre.</td>', 'Nice lighting! I would have taken the left black structure off (crop), keeping the glass off-centre.', '2005-11-17 16:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877596, 258061, 46461, '<td valign="top">Good idea, well lit, well executed, nice way it fades away. Perhaps the stucture/texture of the leaf could be more emphasized, but it is clearly the best leafphoto I have seen in this challenge so far, and there have been some.</td>', 'Good idea, well lit, well executed, nice way it fades away. Perhaps the stucture/texture of the leaf could be more emphasized, but it is clearly the best leafphoto I have seen in this challenge so far, and there have been some.', '2005-11-17 16:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877597, 257992, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwww.     I love this!!!   What a sweet model.   I have a pretty little calico cat too!   She hates having her picture taken tho.  As soon as I get the camera out, she gets very determined not to look at me  :)    That''s why I appreciate this one so much!</td>', 'Awwwww.     I love this!!!   What a sweet model.   I have a pretty little calico cat too!   She hates having her picture taken tho.  As soon as I get the camera out, she gets very determined not to look at me  :)    That''s why I appreciate this one so much!', '2005-11-17 16:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877598, 257992, 46461, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge.  Could probably be improved by rotation. Seems noisy - is that intentional.</td>', 'Fits the challenge.  Could probably be improved by rotation. Seems noisy - is that intentional.', '2005-11-17 16:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877599, 257946, 24454, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done!!!!    One of the absolute best here!    Course it doesn''t hurt any that the model is so handsome  :)   10</td>', 'Beautifully done!!!!    One of the absolute best here!    Course it doesn''t hurt any that the model is so handsome  :)   10', '2005-11-17 16:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
