(1879872, 257861, 18799, '<td valign="top">This may be a single light source, but it is a bit flat.  Maybe some additional saturation would have made the image pop a little more.</td>', 'This may be a single light source, but it is a bit flat.  Maybe some additional saturation would have made the image pop a little more.', '2005-11-18 11:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879876, 257707, 18799, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what the point of the photo is, but it just doesn''t do anything for me.  Maybe from a different and more dynamic angle?   The harsh shadows are distracting too.  I think if the background were farther back, the shadows would have been less harsh and the wrinkled backdrop would have been more pleasantly out of focus.   <br/>Not trying to be mean, just constructive.</td>', 'I''m not sure what the point of the photo is, but it just doesn''t do anything for me.  Maybe from a different and more dynamic angle?   The harsh shadows are distracting too.  I think if the background were farther back, the shadows would have been less harsh and the wrinkled backdrop would have been more pleasantly out of focus.   Not trying to be mean, just constructive.', '2005-11-18 11:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
