(1879956, 258087, 18799, '<td valign="top">The problem here is that these are not grounded anywhere and seem to be floating in mid-air.</td>', 'The problem here is that these are not grounded anywhere and seem to be floating in mid-air.', '2005-11-18 12:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879957, 257994, 32084, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice effort.  The noise is quite high probably due to either the ISO or this is what you were going for.  IMO, the noise would work if you converted this to B&amp;W and then boosted the contrast.  I do really like it.</td>', 'This is a really nice effort.  The noise is quite high probably due to either the ISO or this is what you were going for.  IMO, the noise would work if you converted this to B&W and then boosted the contrast.  I do really like it.', '2005-11-18 12:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879964, 256325, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think the light is too harsh and the picture too sharp for this portrait.  The bright highlights on the face make it look very oily, and the pores and textures of the skin are not appealing.  Maybe something to diffuse the light would have been better here.  5</td>', 'I think the light is too harsh and the picture too sharp for this portrait.  The bright highlights on the face make it look very oily, and the pores and textures of the skin are not appealing.  Maybe something to diffuse the light would have been better here.  5', '2005-11-18 12:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879968, 256762, 32084, '<td valign="top">This is a classic, but great shot.  I feel it is too centered and maybe a little more fall-off on the right side or changing the angle slightly would give us more to look at.  Also, a little sharper might offer up more detail in the skin.  Good job.</td>', 'This is a classic, but great shot.  I feel it is too centered and maybe a little more fall-off on the right side or changing the angle slightly would give us more to look at.  Also, a little sharper might offer up more detail in the skin.  Good job.', '2005-11-18 12:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
