(1880788, 256243, 35066, '<td valign="top">way over contrasted and way too post edited..</td>', 'way over contrasted and way too post edited..', '2005-11-18 17:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880789, 258088, 35066, '<td valign="top">simple shot, but love the lighting!</td>', 'simple shot, but love the lighting!', '2005-11-18 17:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880793, 257454, 35066, '<td valign="top">i dont know what it is.. But I like it!</td>', 'i dont know what it is.. But I like it!', '2005-11-18 17:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880799, 258194, 33732, '<td valign="top">The board is distractingly light.</td>', 'The board is distractingly light.', '2005-11-18 17:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880802, 258140, 33732, '<td valign="top">Mushrooms.  You have nice color.  Shadows are lost somewhat with the dark background.</td>', 'Mushrooms.  You have nice color.  Shadows are lost somewhat with the dark background.', '2005-11-18 17:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880814, 258017, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the tones in this picture and the variety of textures (raised texture in lamp, soft texture of background and smooth texture of the statue).  I wish the light wasn''t so bright and the dark parts of the statue didn''t fade completely into black though.  Otherwise, a nice shot.</td>', 'I like the tones in this picture and the variety of textures (raised texture in lamp, soft texture of background and smooth texture of the statue).  I wish the light wasn''t so bright and the dark parts of the statue didn''t fade completely into black though.  Otherwise, a nice shot.', '2005-11-18 17:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880824, 258181, 47852, '<td valign="top">I think this shot is just a little too dark, and the 2 red dots on the top of the figure distract me.  I like the idea you were going for though.</td>', 'I think this shot is just a little too dark, and the 2 red dots on the top of the figure distract me.  I like the idea you were going for though.', '2005-11-18 17:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880949, 256560, 6519, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge, I have no suggestions for improvement.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge, I have no suggestions for improvement.', '2005-11-18 18:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880956, 258097, 6519, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in this challenge.  I guess the appeal of it might lie in the surprise of seeing the FLOWER  less colorful and less visible/important  than the vase. I love the light, the textures, the composition. Very nice.</td>', 'One of my favorites in this challenge.  I guess the appeal of it might lie in the surprise of seeing the FLOWER  less colorful and less visible/important  than the vase. I love the light, the textures, the composition. Very nice.', '2005-11-18 18:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880960, 258061, 6519, '<td valign="top">You resisted the urge to add waterdrops, yet you still managed to create something VERY beautiful in its simplicity. I love the color and the clear lines. Very nice pic.  My only gripe is in the bottom right hand corner - a finger??????</td>', 'You resisted the urge to add waterdrops, yet you still managed to create something VERY beautiful in its simplicity. I love the color and the clear lines. Very nice pic.  My only gripe is in the bottom right hand corner - a finger??????', '2005-11-18 18:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880963, 258074, 6519, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea and execution. <br/>The leaves seem to all have pretty similar colors, I wonder if this would look even better if the colors were more different.</td>', 'Lovely idea and execution. The leaves seem to all have pretty similar colors, I wonder if this would look even better if the colors were more different.', '2005-11-18 18:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880969, 258235, 47483, '<td valign="top">very good composition. I do not know whether you put knowingly or unknowingly, the purple(or magenta) is usually one color lot of people like subconsciencly. These two color combinations (in case with yellow) are usually used in ads. Other examples would be black and red (exploited very much).<br/>Go got my ten so far. <br/></td>', 'very good composition. I do not know whether you put knowingly or unknowingly, the purple(or magenta) is usually one color lot of people like subconsciencly. These two color combinations (in case with yellow) are usually used in ads. Other examples would be black and red (exploited very much).Go got my ten so far. ', '2005-11-18 18:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880974, 258204, 48259, '<td valign="top">perfect, the lighting makes him look old and wise</td>', 'perfect, the lighting makes him look old and wise', '2005-11-18 18:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880975, 258006, 6519, '<td valign="top">I can see the "single artificial lightsource", but I wonder if the photo would benefit from a bit more ambient light.</td>', 'I can see the "single artificial lightsource", but I wonder if the photo would benefit from a bit more ambient light.', '2005-11-18 18:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880983, 255876, 6519, '<td valign="top">It is interesting how you focused on the reflections, but I find this photo a bit too busy with no real focal point for my eyes to settle on.</td>', 'It is interesting how you focused on the reflections, but I find this photo a bit too busy with no real focal point for my eyes to settle on.', '2005-11-18 18:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880985, 257994, 25218, '<td valign="top">A very contemplative pose, which the lighting &amp; noise helps to create a mood. I think this would like this better in b/w, though.</td>', 'A very contemplative pose, which the lighting & noise helps to create a mood. I think this would like this better in b/w, though.', '2005-11-18 18:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880986, 257136, 29009, '<td valign="top">Emotive, nice natural framing.  I believe the challenge specified an artificial light source?  Overall, a very nice shot.</td>', 'Emotive, nice natural framing.  I believe the challenge specified an artificial light source?  Overall, a very nice shot.', '2005-11-18 18:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880990, 257635, 29009, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of DOF.</td>', 'Excellent use of DOF.', '2005-11-18 18:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880994, 257826, 6519, '<td valign="top">I wonder just exactly what is doing the spining (or even spinning).  I can''t work out what to look at in this picture.</td>', 'I wonder just exactly what is doing the spining (or even spinning).  I can''t work out what to look at in this picture.', '2005-11-18 18:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880996, 257637, 25218, '<td valign="top">This is very sweet, and the lighting is excellent, but I''m not sure it''s "dramatically" lit. 6</td>', 'This is very sweet, and the lighting is excellent, but I''m not sure it''s "dramatically" lit. 6', '2005-11-18 18:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880997, 256848, 29009, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lines, excellent composition.  I believe the challenge was to use a single source of artificial light.  Nevertheless, it''s a great shot!</td>', 'Nice use of lines, excellent composition.  I believe the challenge was to use a single source of artificial light.  Nevertheless, it''s a great shot!', '2005-11-18 18:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1880999, 258239, 6519, '<td valign="top">Yup, it''s a room, but a sunny window doesn''t count as a "single, artificial light source". Perhaps showing a half finished painting might add interest to this pic.</td>', 'Yup, it''s a room, but a sunny window doesn''t count as a "single, artificial light source". Perhaps showing a half finished painting might add interest to this pic.', '2005-11-18 18:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881000, 258211, 6519, '<td valign="top">This is such a picturesque spot, but sunlight doesn''t count as a "single, artificial light source". I would love to see this in color, too. Nice composition.</td>', 'This is such a picturesque spot, but sunlight doesn''t count as a "single, artificial light source". I would love to see this in color, too. Nice composition.', '2005-11-18 18:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881003, 258010, 6519, '<td valign="top">This is low light and low contrast - hard to see what we''re looking at. A not so dead-center position might make it a little more interesting, too.</td>', 'This is low light and low contrast - hard to see what we''re looking at. A not so dead-center position might make it a little more interesting, too.', '2005-11-18 18:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881008, 256243, 6519, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition here, but the over exposed look doesn''t appeal to me.</td>', 'Interesting composition here, but the over exposed look doesn''t appeal to me.', '2005-11-18 18:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881013, 256423, 6519, '<td valign="top">Oh how cute - they DO look like funny faces! <br/>I have some suggestion for possibly improving this photo: a) use a smaller aperture so both flowers are in focus and b) a less busy (or not so bright) background would guide more attention to the stars of this show.</td>', 'Oh how cute - they DO look like funny faces! I have some suggestion for possibly improving this photo: a) use a smaller aperture so both flowers are in focus and b) a less busy (or not so bright) background would guide more attention to the stars of this show.', '2005-11-18 18:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881016, 257124, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment and bumping up.  This is really quite lovely - composition is good, lighting is excellent, clearly meets challenge, technically well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Returning for comment and bumping up.  This is really quite lovely - composition is good, lighting is excellent, clearly meets challenge, technically well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-11-18 18:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881020, 255803, 6519, '<td valign="top">I don''t like Bob''s straight, centered position, but I DO like the color combinations you chose (Bob, cushion and superb background),  the wonderful moody lighting, and even the discreet border. A sweet and pleasing "portrait".</td>', 'I don''t like Bob''s straight, centered position, but I DO like the color combinations you chose (Bob, cushion and superb background),  the wonderful moody lighting, and even the discreet border. A sweet and pleasing "portrait".', '2005-11-18 18:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881021, 257856, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment and bumping up 2 points.  Composition is excellent, lots of visual interest here.  Focus is tack-sharp, lighting is excellent.  I don''t have enough praise.  (10)</td>', 'Returning for comment and bumping up 2 points.  Composition is excellent, lots of visual interest here.  Focus is tack-sharp, lighting is excellent.  I don''t have enough praise.  (10)', '2005-11-18 18:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881022, 258141, 6519, '<td valign="top">Ummm.....well...... some pretty colors happened here.</td>', 'Ummm.....well...... some pretty colors happened here.', '2005-11-18 19:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881026, 256776, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment and bumping up 2 points.  Lots of visual interest, clearly meets challenge, composition is good... Nice work!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Returning for comment and bumping up 2 points.  Lots of visual interest, clearly meets challenge, composition is good... Nice work!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-11-18 19:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881027, 258112, 29009, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - I love the drops dribbling off the chin!  This is one instance where the title really nails it.  Good job!</td>', 'Nicely done - I love the drops dribbling off the chin!  This is one instance where the title really nails it.  Good job!', '2005-11-18 19:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881029, 258172, 6519, '<td valign="top">That very nearly counts as NO light source. Yes, my monitor is calibrated and yes, I can see the dog''s face, but there just isn''t enough TO look at to make it interesting. Must have been a challenge to focus in so little light. 5</td>', 'That very nearly counts as NO light source. Yes, my monitor is calibrated and yes, I can see the dog''s face, but there just isn''t enough TO look at to make it interesting. Must have been a challenge to focus in so little light. 5', '2005-11-18 19:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881030, 257791, 6519, '<td valign="top">I love this photo - it has charm! Very nice lighting and clear details. Good composition, too - that angle is pretty much perfect!</td>', 'I love this photo - it has charm! Very nice lighting and clear details. Good composition, too - that angle is pretty much perfect!', '2005-11-18 19:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881035, 257124, 6519, '<td valign="top">Pretty and clear, with a good, solidly black background. Perhaps a touch more off-center would look even better.</td>', 'Pretty and clear, with a good, solidly black background. Perhaps a touch more off-center would look even better.', '2005-11-18 19:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881038, 258189, 6519, '<td valign="top">Well executed. The hands help me "navigate" (for want of a better word) in that darkness. Good expression and solidly black background, too.</td>', 'Well executed. The hands help me "navigate" (for want of a better word) in that darkness. Good expression and solidly black background, too.', '2005-11-18 19:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881041, 257680, 6519, '<td valign="top">The sun is not an ARTIFICIAL light source. Apart from  that, the framing (arch) certainly adds appeal to this picture.</td>', 'The sun is not an ARTIFICIAL light source. Apart from  that, the framing (arch) certainly adds appeal to this picture.', '2005-11-18 19:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881046, 258032, 6519, '<td valign="top">My impression is that the light is coming from a sunny window (with closed blinds), so it doesn''t count as "single, artificial light source", but I like the angles here, and the variety of stripes and curves.</td>', 'My impression is that the light is coming from a sunny window (with closed blinds), so it doesn''t count as "single, artificial light source", but I like the angles here, and the variety of stripes and curves.', '2005-11-18 19:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881065, 257860, 47378, '<td valign="top">A little sharper focus would help.</td>', 'A little sharper focus would help.', '2005-11-18 19:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881067, 258054, 47378, '<td valign="top">The sun isn''t an artificial light source. Nice picture, nevertheless.</td>', 'The sun isn''t an artificial light source. Nice picture, nevertheless.', '2005-11-18 19:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881076, 257862, 47378, '<td valign="top">Very sharp picture considering the small amount of light that was used.</td>', 'Very sharp picture considering the small amount of light that was used.', '2005-11-18 19:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881078, 257329, 47378, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic--well done.</td>', 'Very dramatic--well done.', '2005-11-18 19:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881085, 257570, 47378, '<td valign="top">It appears that the right side is lit up as well, suggesting 2 light sources. It still looks cool, though.</td>', 'It appears that the right side is lit up as well, suggesting 2 light sources. It still looks cool, though.', '2005-11-18 19:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881087, 257760, 38161, '<td valign="top">lil weak on focus but nice colors...5</td>', 'lil weak on focus but nice colors...5', '2005-11-18 19:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881088, 257139, 3102, '<td valign="top">Excellent job -- my only 10 of the challenge.</td>', 'Excellent job -- my only 10 of the challenge.', '2005-11-18 19:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881089, 255687, 38161, '<td valign="top">yeah baby !</td>', 'yeah baby !', '2005-11-18 19:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881094, 257948, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  I''ll be curious to read the details on this one, since this almost looks to me like the sparkly things were attached to her face, as opposed to it being a mask of some sort.  Anyway, job well done!</td>', 'Very cool shot!  I''ll be curious to read the details on this one, since this almost looks to me like the sparkly things were attached to her face, as opposed to it being a mask of some sort.  Anyway, job well done!', '2005-11-18 19:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881099, 256560, 3102, '<td valign="top">A leaf isn''t necessarily the most exciting topic in the world, but I love what you''ve done with it here!  I love the toning of it, and the DOF is great.  Kudos!</td>', 'A leaf isn''t necessarily the most exciting topic in the world, but I love what you''ve done with it here!  I love the toning of it, and the DOF is great.  Kudos!', '2005-11-18 19:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1881101, 256130, 40226, '<td valign="top">What''s with the coins?  Boring.  Sorry.</td>', 'What''s with the coins?  Boring.  Sorry.', '2005-11-18 19:40:27.000000', NULL, 1);
