(1882357, 257992, 47956, '<td valign="top">needs better focussing, composition not bad though</td>', 'needs better focussing, composition not bad though', '2005-11-19 05:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882410, 256035, 29009, '<td valign="top">This was a risk.  The lighting is brightest on the chest, which makes the nudity seems gratuitous rather than an artistic shot of someone who also happens to be nude.  The lack of focus is a technical deficiency that cannot be overcome.  The large shadow is very distracting and doesn''t add much when considering visual interest.  It''s good that you tried something different, but overall this shot has too many technical issues to be a winner.</td>', 'This was a risk.  The lighting is brightest on the chest, which makes the nudity seems gratuitous rather than an artistic shot of someone who also happens to be nude.  The lack of focus is a technical deficiency that cannot be overcome.  The large shadow is very distracting and doesn''t add much when considering visual interest.  It''s good that you tried something different, but overall this shot has too many technical issues to be a winner.', '2005-11-19 07:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882411, 258054, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment and bumping up.  Composition is good, horizon line is properly placed and straight.  Foreground elements add to visual interest; however, shadow detail has been lost.  Nice colors in a good dramatic sky.  As far as meeting the challenge, I believe it was supposed to include a single source of artificial light so in that regard I don''t believe this particular shot meets the challenge as well as some of the other entries.  Overall, this is a good shot.</td>', 'Returning for comment and bumping up.  Composition is good, horizon line is properly placed and straight.  Foreground elements add to visual interest; however, shadow detail has been lost.  Nice colors in a good dramatic sky.  As far as meeting the challenge, I believe it was supposed to include a single source of artificial light so in that regard I don''t believe this particular shot meets the challenge as well as some of the other entries.  Overall, this is a good shot.', '2005-11-19 07:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882413, 257568, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment and bumping up.  Composition is good - nice job filling the frame.  Colors have impact.  With regard to visual interest, well, I personally am not getting an artistic message and don''t really see this as super-creative.  You have met the challenge spot-on with a single source of artificial light.  Not sure I''d call this shot out of focus, but it''s not particularly sharp either.  Maybe a quicker shutter speed would have reduced the haloing/bleeding effect of the light.  Overall, it''s a decent shot.</td>', 'Returning for comment and bumping up.  Composition is good - nice job filling the frame.  Colors have impact.  With regard to visual interest, well, I personally am not getting an artistic message and don''t really see this as super-creative.  You have met the challenge spot-on with a single source of artificial light.  Not sure I''d call this shot out of focus, but it''s not particularly sharp either.  Maybe a quicker shutter speed would have reduced the haloing/bleeding effect of the light.  Overall, it''s a decent shot.', '2005-11-19 07:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882416, 257826, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  Sorry, I''ve come back to this three times and still can''t figure out what it is.  Personally, I don''t care much for abstracts unless they are super colorful and this shot just doesn''t hold my visual interest.  When compared to other entries in the challenge, this particular shot is weaker in that whatever you were trying to convey just went over my head.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  Sorry, I''ve come back to this three times and still can''t figure out what it is.  Personally, I don''t care much for abstracts unless they are super colorful and this shot just doesn''t hold my visual interest.  When compared to other entries in the challenge, this particular shot is weaker in that whatever you were trying to convey just went over my head.', '2005-11-19 07:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882419, 258172, 29009, '<td valign="top">Returning for comment.  I think this is a dog?  I''ve checked this on a couple of different monitors and IMHO too much shadow detail is lost.  You''ve got a nice catchlight in the eye, but I suspect the eye is all most voters can see on their monitors.  With regard to composition, it looks like you''ve filled the frame and that you''ve composed according to rule of thirds well.  Meets challenge as far as single articificial light source, but the severe loss of shadow detail is a technical deficiency that will be hard to overcome.</td>', 'Returning for comment.  I think this is a dog?  I''ve checked this on a couple of different monitors and IMHO too much shadow detail is lost.  You''ve got a nice catchlight in the eye, but I suspect the eye is all most voters can see on their monitors.  With regard to composition, it looks like you''ve filled the frame and that you''ve composed according to rule of thirds well.  Meets challenge as far as single articificial light source, but the severe loss of shadow detail is a technical deficiency that will be hard to overcome.', '2005-11-19 07:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882423, 256774, 29009, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, I can see how the use of lines was intended to strengthen the imagery.  I''m not sure the background works as well as you intended.  Unfortunately, there are some blown-out spots on the guitar and also on the closet door.  The lack of focus is severe here and (if intentional) doesn''t work when considering the impact of the lines.  This is a decent idea but the shot is technically weak with regard to exposure and focus, and those deficiencies will be hard to overcome.  Better luck in the next challenge!</td>', 'Composition is good, I can see how the use of lines was intended to strengthen the imagery.  I''m not sure the background works as well as you intended.  Unfortunately, there are some blown-out spots on the guitar and also on the closet door.  The lack of focus is severe here and (if intentional) doesn''t work when considering the impact of the lines.  This is a decent idea but the shot is technically weak with regard to exposure and focus, and those deficiencies will be hard to overcome.  Better luck in the next challenge!', '2005-11-19 07:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882459, 257964, 8140, '<td valign="top">IMO it is very blurry and it is not clear enough to recognise the object. colors are also desaturated too much 3</td>', 'IMO it is very blurry and it is not clear enough to recognise the object. colors are also desaturated too much 3', '2005-11-19 08:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882461, 258050, 8140, '<td valign="top">excellent lights. good composition. red color looks live on the background 8</td>', 'excellent lights. good composition. red color looks live on the background 8', '2005-11-19 08:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882462, 256187, 8140, '<td valign="top">IMO this is more for some catalog photo challenge than for this. their is no drama, or something else specific. it looks and it is like regular catalog photo 3</td>', 'IMO this is more for some catalog photo challenge than for this. their is no drama, or something else specific. it looks and it is like regular catalog photo 3', '2005-11-19 08:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882464, 256774, 8140, '<td valign="top">blurry, out of focus, colors are like more desaturated</td>', 'blurry, out of focus, colors are like more desaturated', '2005-11-19 08:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882468, 257388, 47117, '<td valign="top">For some reason I cannot access my PM''s for answering, so I will use this forum.  From email it keeps telling me to login, when I have. From the site, I don''t see a link. Sometimes it works by email and sometimes not for some reason.  Anyway,  I have taken another look at your photo. The grass, only at the base is in focus.  The tips of the grass to the tree on the right to the sky is all in blurriness.  It looks like a shot taken at dusk, and not with the artificial light source of a flash, but of the sun.  I like to see artificial light sources actually used in the photo for this challenge. Otherwise it just becomes a free study, IMO.  A lot of photos failed the challenge in my eyes due to that fact.  In any case, I will not be reaccessing due to just not finding this an appealing photo for this challenge.</td>', 'For some reason I cannot access my PM''s for answering, so I will use this forum.  From email it keeps telling me to login, when I have. From the site, I don''t see a link. Sometimes it works by email and sometimes not for some reason.  Anyway,  I have taken another look at your photo. The grass, only at the base is in focus.  The tips of the grass to the tree on the right to the sky is all in blurriness.  It looks like a shot taken at dusk, and not with the artificial light source of a flash, but of the sun.  I like to see artificial light sources actually used in the photo for this challenge. Otherwise it just becomes a free study, IMO.  A lot of photos failed the challenge in my eyes due to that fact.  In any case, I will not be reaccessing due to just not finding this an appealing photo for this challenge.', '2005-11-19 08:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882472, 257136, 47117, '<td valign="top">EDITED TO ADD: I cannot answer my PM''s from the site, or email, for some reason. But I wanted to just say that I don''t hate this photo. I think it is a very nice moon shot.  And your technical interpretation of an artificial light source being the moon for the reflection of the sun''s light upon it, IS an interesting one.  For that I will bump you up 2 points.  Thank you for writing.</td>', 'EDITED TO ADD: I cannot answer my PM''s from the site, or email, for some reason. But I wanted to just say that I don''t hate this photo. I think it is a very nice moon shot.  And your technical interpretation of an artificial light source being the moon for the reflection of the sun''s light upon it, IS an interesting one.  For that I will bump you up 2 points.  Thank you for writing.', '2005-11-19 08:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882473, 257948, 8140, '<td valign="top">you missed the challenge. this should be uploaded for the camouflage challenge</td>', 'you missed the challenge. this should be uploaded for the camouflage challenge', '2005-11-19 08:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
