(1885225, 257637, 40019, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  Adorable child!  Perfect lighting - produces the right shadows, keeps the rich colors - great focus on the eyes.  Nicely done!  Whatever''s next to her (cat?) is a little distracting - but not much you can do with a capture like this.</td>', 'Great capture!  Adorable child!  Perfect lighting - produces the right shadows, keeps the rich colors - great focus on the eyes.  Nicely done!  Whatever''s next to her (cat?) is a little distracting - but not much you can do with a capture like this.', '2005-11-20 18:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885226, 258061, 32966, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colour and shot!</td>', 'Beautiful colour and shot!', '2005-11-20 18:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885231, 257631, 32966, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this without the shadow on the right but it is still a lovely shot.</td>', 'I''d like to see this without the shadow on the right but it is still a lovely shot.', '2005-11-20 18:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885233, 258192, 40019, '<td valign="top">You needed a little more light on this shot (IMO).  More light would have reduced the grain and produced a more silky texture to the skin.  Just my view. :-)</td>', 'You needed a little more light on this shot (IMO).  More light would have reduced the grain and produced a more silky texture to the skin.  Just my view. :-)', '2005-11-20 18:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885235, 258092, 40019, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Image and title work well together. Good focus and DOF.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Image and title work well together. Good focus and DOF.', '2005-11-20 18:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885241, 258112, 32966, '<td valign="top">Great colours and silhouette!</td>', 'Great colours and silhouette!', '2005-11-20 18:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885242, 256774, 40019, '<td valign="top">Looks like you tried this handheld, I would suggest a tripod for low lighting situations like this.  The closet background also detracts from your subject, which is the guitar - a plain wall would have been a better background.</td>', 'Looks like you tried this handheld, I would suggest a tripod for low lighting situations like this.  The closet background also detracts from your subject, which is the guitar - a plain wall would have been a better background.', '2005-11-20 18:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
