(1885268, 257558, 32966, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2005-11-20 18:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885293, 256710, 32966, '<td valign="top">Awww, he''s adorable.   Great idea for a wonderful shot.</td>', 'Awww, he''s adorable.   Great idea for a wonderful shot.', '2005-11-20 18:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885298, 258235, 32966, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a very pretty abstract here.</td>', 'You''ve captured a very pretty abstract here.', '2005-11-20 18:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885300, 258112, 48344, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouetted effect; the gradient blue is perfectly lovely and offsets well the warm amber liquid contained in the glass, that reappears trickling down the chin, adding movement to a generally still-looking picture, but only once the gaze has travelled its own way there.<br/> <br/>Very good dynamics in this picture !</td>', 'I like the silhouetted effect; the gradient blue is perfectly lovely and offsets well the warm amber liquid contained in the glass, that reappears trickling down the chin, adding movement to a generally still-looking picture, but only once the gaze has travelled its own way there. Very good dynamics in this picture !', '2005-11-20 18:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885302, 256448, 38924, '<td valign="top">I really like the color and urban feel.  Too bad it''s not sharper.</td>', 'I really like the color and urban feel.  Too bad it''s not sharper.', '2005-11-20 18:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885304, 258182, 48344, '<td valign="top">Good grain, balanced tones and interesting composition.</td>', 'Good grain, balanced tones and interesting composition.', '2005-11-20 18:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885305, 258102, 32966, '<td valign="top">Sleek and modern looking.  I really like the compostion and the light.  Great work.</td>', 'Sleek and modern looking.  I really like the compostion and the light.  Great work.', '2005-11-20 18:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885306, 258157, 48297, '<td valign="top">Well done! The composition takes you back to another era of life less complicated, and the lighting enhances the subject beautifully.<br/></td>', 'Well done! The composition takes you back to another era of life less complicated, and the lighting enhances the subject beautifully.', '2005-11-20 18:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885308, 258140, 1041, '<td valign="top">While it certainly looks as if you used a single lightsource for the image, I don''t think it adds drama, or is even an improvement for the image.  Some more even lighting and lack of shadow would be better, IMO.  I do like the arrangement and colors, and the background you used, it''s not very typical for this kind of shot but it adds even more texture. ... reminds me that it''s almost about time to make supper :)</td>', 'While it certainly looks as if you used a single lightsource for the image, I don''t think it adds drama, or is even an improvement for the image.  Some more even lighting and lack of shadow would be better, IMO.  I do like the arrangement and colors, and the background you used, it''s not very typical for this kind of shot but it adds even more texture. ... reminds me that it''s almost about time to make supper :)', '2005-11-20 18:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885311, 258154, 48344, '<td valign="top">Excellent highlighting of the... spider ? and its web. :)<br/> <br/>It''s lighting up the picture, beautiful.</td>', 'Excellent highlighting of the... spider ? and its web. :) It''s lighting up the picture, beautiful.', '2005-11-20 18:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885312, 257120, 1041, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Not quite a silhouette, since there''s discernable detail, but yet enough in the shadow to leave a lot to the imagination.  If it was an advanced editing challenge, I would edit out the one line above the neck (you maybe would''ve, too).  Great work!</td>', 'Love it.  Not quite a silhouette, since there''s discernable detail, but yet enough in the shadow to leave a lot to the imagination.  If it was an advanced editing challenge, I would edit out the one line above the neck (you maybe would''ve, too).  Great work!', '2005-11-20 18:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885315, 257764, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Reflection makes the image.  Some dust is highlighted on the board (don''t you wish it was advanced editing? And if you could''ve shielded the pawn to the right even more from the light it would have been perfect.  As it is, I still like it very much!</td>', 'Very nice.  Reflection makes the image.  Some dust is highlighted on the board (don''t you wish it was advanced editing? And if you could''ve shielded the pawn to the right even more from the light it would have been perfect.  As it is, I still like it very much!', '2005-11-20 18:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885322, 258022, 1041, '<td valign="top">I hope people read your title, otherwise I imagine you would get a few ones.  Like the colors and the silhouette, It does look to me as if  the image is oversharpened.  Good work, maybe re-process if you are in the mood..</td>', 'I hope people read your title, otherwise I imagine you would get a few ones.  Like the colors and the silhouette, It does look to me as if  the image is oversharpened.  Good work, maybe re-process if you are in the mood..', '2005-11-20 19:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885325, 257353, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice starbursts.  Good photo, but one that doesn''t hold my interest for long.  Guess I''m not guitar-player.</td>', 'Nice starbursts.  Good photo, but one that doesn''t hold my interest for long.  Guess I''m not guitar-player.', '2005-11-20 19:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885327, 257594, 1041, '<td valign="top">A hard one to take wiht a single lightsource.  I think the mouse should be brigher in the image, but I like the monitor as it is.  Good concept, maybe worth redoing wiht more than a single lightsource for outside of the challenge?</td>', 'A hard one to take wiht a single lightsource.  I think the mouse should be brigher in the image, but I like the monitor as it is.  Good concept, maybe worth redoing wiht more than a single lightsource for outside of the challenge?', '2005-11-20 19:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885329, 257996, 1041, '<td valign="top">I think this one would''ve lent itself for a square crop ... the black on the left leaves the image feeling unbalanced for me.  Having said that, I like the idea a lot.</td>', 'I think this one would''ve lent itself for a square crop ... the black on the left leaves the image feeling unbalanced for me.  Having said that, I like the idea a lot.', '2005-11-20 19:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885335, 257139, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Great emotional subject matter, lighting is great (eye really is drawing to the belly since it''s the brightest).  Like the toning.  Guy''s tatoo adds an unexpected twist, makes it even more personal.</td>', 'Very nice.  Great emotional subject matter, lighting is great (eye really is drawing to the belly since it''s the brightest).  Like the toning.  Guy''s tatoo adds an unexpected twist, makes it even more personal.', '2005-11-20 19:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885338, 258143, 32966, '<td valign="top">Very clever and original!</td>', 'Very clever and original!', '2005-11-20 19:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885362, 258143, 45320, '<td valign="top">I like what you have done with the fiber optics here a very good use for them nice photo but could maby have done with being a bit sharper 9</td>', 'I like what you have done with the fiber optics here a very good use for them nice photo but could maby have done with being a bit sharper 9', '2005-11-20 19:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885371, 258046, 10080, '<td valign="top">very nice in every way! my only little nit pik is that little bit of light at the far right under the arm. But believe me its a tiny observance. 9</td>', 'very nice in every way! my only little nit pik is that little bit of light at the far right under the arm. But believe me its a tiny observance. 9', '2005-11-20 19:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885373, 258024, 10080, '<td valign="top">Whew! Gorgeous!!  The pictures pretty good too! Hehehe! Nice work. 9</td>', 'Whew! Gorgeous!!  The pictures pretty good too! Hehehe! Nice work. 9', '2005-11-20 19:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885374, 256287, 10080, '<td valign="top">Awsome work! I would have liked to see a little breast.....but all guys do. Hehehe! It really keeps your eye moving around the pic! 9</td>', 'Awsome work! I would have liked to see a little breast.....but all guys do. Hehehe! It really keeps your eye moving around the pic! 9', '2005-11-20 19:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885376, 256397, 10080, '<td valign="top">Very cool and kinda creepy! Nice effect. 9</td>', 'Very cool and kinda creepy! Nice effect. 9', '2005-11-20 19:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885381, 258143, 48297, '<td valign="top">So creative! (We could all use a little armoral face protection) Great lighting effects.</td>', 'So creative! (We could all use a little armoral face protection) Great lighting effects.', '2005-11-20 19:33:05.000000', NULL, 1);
