(1886043, 258130, 42601, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea. I think the centre point is a bit too bright. the guy on the right''s face is a bit overexposed. I think a smaller aperture might have solved this problem. Good shot nonetheless!!</td>', 'Very nice idea. I think the centre point is a bit too bright. the guy on the right''s face is a bit overexposed. I think a smaller aperture might have solved this problem. Good shot nonetheless!!', '2005-11-21 00:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886049, 256987, 42601, '<td valign="top">Creepy! A bit too much noise for me and I think you couldve cropped it underneath a bit more.</td>', 'Creepy! A bit too much noise for me and I think you couldve cropped it underneath a bit more.', '2005-11-21 00:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886056, 257677, 42601, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, I just think your crop couldve improved a little. The image just doesnt sit dead centre with me.</td>', 'Nice idea, I just think your crop couldve improved a little. The image just doesnt sit dead centre with me.', '2005-11-21 00:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886063, 258134, 42601, '<td valign="top">Nice image! I must admit, I am sick of seeing all those red and yellow leaves on trees (we dont get them here), but youve done something really nice with this one. A bit overexposded on the side of the leaf on the right, but I think its just because of the discoloration... nice shot.</td>', 'Nice image! I must admit, I am sick of seeing all those red and yellow leaves on trees (we dont get them here), but youve done something really nice with this one. A bit overexposded on the side of the leaf on the right, but I think its just because of the discoloration... nice shot.', '2005-11-21 00:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886069, 257820, 42601, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2005-11-21 00:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886080, 257531, 42601, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot... one thing though is that the figurine is a bit overexposed (could be my screen) but I had the same problems when I tried to shoot one. It''s just his back thats a bit much, but nothing too serious. Well done.</td>', 'Excellent shot... one thing though is that the figurine is a bit overexposed (could be my screen) but I had the same problems when I tried to shoot one. It''s just his back thats a bit much, but nothing too serious. Well done.', '2005-11-21 00:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886084, 257690, 42601, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image, well done.</td>', 'Wonderful image, well done.', '2005-11-21 00:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886090, 258079, 42601, '<td valign="top">Mmmhh... I see what you were trying to do here, but I think the fact that I can see her face threw it a bit off for me. Maybe if she was a complete sillhouette, it would make a slight difference, cause as it stands I feel I have to see something. Nice attempt though!</td>', 'Mmmhh... I see what you were trying to do here, but I think the fact that I can see her face threw it a bit off for me. Maybe if she was a complete sillhouette, it would make a slight difference, cause as it stands I feel I have to see something. Nice attempt though!', '2005-11-21 00:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886093, 257293, 42601, '<td valign="top">Good, clean photo!</td>', 'Good, clean photo!', '2005-11-21 00:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886099, 256405, 42601, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but the lamp in the background kinda ruins it for me. I can clearly see some light coming from the front, and I also think a part of the mic on the left couldve been cropped shorter. Altogether though, its a nice shot!</td>', 'Very nice, but the lamp in the background kinda ruins it for me. I can clearly see some light coming from the front, and I also think a part of the mic on the left couldve been cropped shorter. Altogether though, its a nice shot!', '2005-11-21 00:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
