(1891434, 257642, 47959, '<td valign="top">Wow...did not expect this to make it in the top 20...thank you all! Believe it or not, the title was entirely accidental. I did not realize the connection, the title was given in a hurry when i looked at the on ly thing in sharp focus, so you can say the subliminal joke is on me...<br/> <br/>Again, thanks fot the votes and the critique. Great site!</td>', 'Wow...did not expect this to make it in the top 20...thank you all! Believe it or not, the title was entirely accidental. I did not realize the connection, the title was given in a hurry when i looked at the on ly thing in sharp focus, so you can say the subliminal joke is on me... Again, thanks fot the votes and the critique. Great site!', '2005-11-23 01:56:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(1891445, 256287, 47575, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo. I wish it would of received a higher score.</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo. I wish it would of received a higher score.', '2005-11-23 02:02:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1891455, 256405, 25952, '<td valign="top">thanks for the comments everyone, well I saw this differently than most people it appears. obviously the lamp is a light source but it has no effect on the lighting on the subject. the challenge said light the subject with a single light source, which is what I did...so hopefully that explains things. I personally liked the lamp in the picture as a photographic element, but to those who saw it distracting (and not as making it not fit the challenge) thank you for the input.</td>', 'thanks for the comments everyone, well I saw this differently than most people it appears. obviously the lamp is a light source but it has no effect on the lighting on the subject. the challenge said light the subject with a single light source, which is what I did...so hopefully that explains things. I personally liked the lamp in the picture as a photographic element, but to those who saw it distracting (and not as making it not fit the challenge) thank you for the input.', '2005-11-23 02:07:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1891460, 255698, 5885, '<td valign="top">That was a cake-topper... WOW!!! I love your technique. Very clever.</td>', 'That was a cake-topper... WOW!!! I love your technique. Very clever.', '2005-11-23 02:09:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1891461, 255734, 39349, '<td valign="top">Hey, You beat out the Dark Lord of the Sith!<br/> <br/>Not a bad shot at all IMHO. One thing I noticed is that it seems blown out in between your index finger and thumb. Other than than clean, well lit shot. I think we were just up against some tough competition in this round my friend.<br/> <br/>NaldSLC</td>', 'Hey, You beat out the Dark Lord of the Sith! Not a bad shot at all IMHO. One thing I noticed is that it seems blown out in between your index finger and thumb. Other than than clean, well lit shot. I think we were just up against some tough competition in this round my friend. NaldSLC', '2005-11-23 02:10:39.000000', NULL, 0),
