(1891526, 257120, 24503, '<td valign="top">Thanks a lot to everyone, especially to the commenters. Is my first photograph with so many comments and they are really good for learning and doing things better. <br/>For the comments I have realized that the glass with red wine wasn''t understood. I tried to make it more clear, but my lightning was very poor.<br/>Thanks to all the voters also (including the ones without camera who gave a 4.667, because they prevent us of thinking that you are a good photographer).<br/>And of course many thanks to wrobel for my first shot being someone''s favorite.<br/></td>', 'Thanks a lot to everyone, especially to the commenters. Is my first photograph with so many comments and they are really good for learning and doing things better. For the comments I have realized that the glass with red wine wasn''t understood. I tried to make it more clear, but my lightning was very poor.Thanks to all the voters also (including the ones without camera who gave a 4.667, because they prevent us of thinking that you are a good photographer).And of course many thanks to wrobel for my first shot being someone''s favorite.', '2005-11-23 02:41:41.000000', NULL, 0),
