(1893177, 257946, 27133, '<td valign="top">Don''t worry about what anybody else has said.  I like it.  To me a person has the beauty on the inside.  You just need to look in their eyes to see that.  If a person wants to do a nude study then they should.  Regardless of their size, shape...or how much hair.  It is just a part of the shell they were given.  Why should it be classed as wrong?  Keep your chin up...what you did was very brave...and I can guarantee you that this image is very pleasing to the eye.  I have seen some horrid nudes and this certainly isn''t in that category.  But regardless....you can at least say that you have tried something new....the others can''t.<br/> <br/>Judi</td>', 'Don''t worry about what anybody else has said.  I like it.  To me a person has the beauty on the inside.  You just need to look in their eyes to see that.  If a person wants to do a nude study then they should.  Regardless of their size, shape...or how much hair.  It is just a part of the shell they were given.  Why should it be classed as wrong?  Keep your chin up...what you did was very brave...and I can guarantee you that this image is very pleasing to the eye.  I have seen some horrid nudes and this certainly isn''t in that category.  But regardless....you can at least say that you have tried something new....the others can''t. Judi', '2005-11-23 16:08:05.000000', NULL, 0),
