(2143581, 258089, 37544, '<td valign="top">This is a very good portrait. I hope you are not offended by the fact that "I" feel that this pose is too mature for this child. That is just my personal opinion. Other than that, the photo is excellent. It does seem a little dark, but considering the challenge that you entered...it makes sense.</td>', 'This is a very good portrait. I hope you are not offended by the fact that "I" feel that this pose is too mature for this child. That is just my personal opinion. Other than that, the photo is excellent. It does seem a little dark, but considering the challenge that you entered...it makes sense.', '2006-02-11 22:03:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2144275, 257749, 48248, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this is superb.  Let me state, with all honesty, that I am putting this in my favorites so I can steal your idea :)</td>', 'The lighting on this is superb.  Let me state, with all honesty, that I am putting this in my favorites so I can steal your idea :)', '2006-02-12 10:23:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(2155804, 257661, 46045, '<td valign="top">haha, i love the irony of the two posts below.   anyway, i like the composition and the focus on the type is good. i just don''t like the colors too much. and the dust on the lightbulb isn''t appealing either.</td>', 'haha, i love the irony of the two posts below.   anyway, i like the composition and the focus on the type is good. i just don''t like the colors too much. and the dust on the lightbulb isn''t appealing either.', '2006-02-16 00:06:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2242498, 256205, 31606, '<td valign="top">Very nice job.  The blue light is noce and the focus is great.  Just above the right side of the cube looks to be some sort of reflection.  Too bad is was basic editing or you could have just cloned it out.  Nice shot that placed well.</td>', 'Very nice job.  The blue light is noce and the focus is great.  Just above the right side of the cube looks to be some sort of reflection.  Too bad is was basic editing or you could have just cloned it out.  Nice shot that placed well.', '2006-03-20 18:32:45.000000', NULL, 0),
