(2413756, 256708, 36628, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, especially with the one light creating really nice predictable highlights in the water. I think the crop hurts it a bit though becasue the leaf, a really vertical object, feels oddly constrained within a horizontal frame. I feel like either a larger horizontal crop or a panoramic vertical would be a lot more effective.</td>', 'I like this shot, especially with the one light creating really nice predictable highlights in the water. I think the crop hurts it a bit though becasue the leaf, a really vertical object, feels oddly constrained within a horizontal frame. I feel like either a larger horizontal crop or a panoramic vertical would be a lot more effective.', '2006-05-14 04:55:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2462962, 258032, 75713, '<td valign="top">I am so glad that your photo wasn''t DQ''ed.... I would never have gotten the chance to see it... When I first looked at this shot, before reading anything, it looked like a magnificant paintbruch creating a magnificant work of art..... this is such an amazing shot that I just look at it in awe..... so stunning - if i were to have voted on it, I would give it 10++++</td>', 'I am so glad that your photo wasn''t DQ''ed.... I would never have gotten the chance to see it... When I first looked at this shot, before reading anything, it looked like a magnificant paintbruch creating a magnificant work of art..... this is such an amazing shot that I just look at it in awe..... so stunning - if i were to have voted on it, I would give it 10++++', '2006-05-28 02:21:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(2478792, 257536, 47608, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the voting and comments!</td>', 'Thanks for the voting and comments!', '2006-06-02 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(2482755, 255752, 21816, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Perhaps you could of off-centred it a little for a bit more impact. The shadow/reflection works really well. Great work.</td>', 'Nice idea. Perhaps you could of off-centred it a little for a bit more impact. The shadow/reflection works really well. Great work.', '2006-06-04 02:17:40.000000', NULL, 0),
